记密码？",changePasswordSuccess:"密码已成功修改",changePasswordFailed:"密码修改失败",changePasswordException:"密码修改请求异常",learnVideoTitle:"做视频只需简单3步",learnVideoSubtitle:"DeepSeek + 蛋壳视界，让小白也能轻松做视频。",step1Title:"1、生成文案",step1Subtitle:"在某平台找到想要模仿的视频，复制视频链接。\n\n科学上网，搜索“Youtube视频下载”、“抖音视频下载”，下载视频。\n\n使用“AI语音识别”工具将视频语音转换为文本。\n\n将文本喂给DeepSeek或ChatGPT，自动生成文案。",step1Button:"AI语音识别",step2Title:"2、资源下载",step2Subtitle:"电影资源下载：科学上网，搜索“电影名 720p torrent”。\n\n其他资源下载：“共享网盘”工具。\n\n如果视频太长，使用“AI长视频切片分析”工具进行切割。",step2Button:"AI视频切片",step3Title:"3、合成视频",step3Subtitle:"把文案和视频切片输入“蛋壳视界”，合成视频。",settingsLabel:"设置",changePassword:"修改密码",backToLogin:"返回",addScene:"添加",replaceScene:"替换"},bt={mainSlogan:"Eggshell Vision",secondSlogan:"Your video starter pack: Powered by AI. Made for beginners.",newVideoProject:"New Video Project",projectName:"Project Name",path:"Path",browseButton:"Browse",width:"Width",height:"Height",selectResolutionTemplate:"Select Resolution Template",cancel:"Cancel",confirm:"Confirm",landscape1280x720:"Landscape 1280 x 720",landscape1920x1080:"Landscape 1920 x 1080",portrait720x1280:"Portrait 720 x 1280",portrait1080x1920:"Portrait 1080 x 1920",chooseReferenceVideo:"Choose reference video",videoFileFilter:"Video files|*.mp4;*.mkv;*.avi",enterProjectName:"Please enter a project name",invalidCharacters:'Name contains invalid characters: \\ / : * ? " < > |',mustBePositiveInteger:" must be a positive integer of at least 200",enterValidProjectName:"Please enter a valid project name.",enterValidWidth:"Please enter a valid width.",enterValidHeight:"Please enter a valid height.",projectAlreadyExists:"A project with the same name already exists in this directory.",addNewClip:"Add New Clip",bodyText:"Main Text",comment:"Comment",commentTooltip:"This is just a note. If the main text is in a foreign language, you can write the Chinese translation here for easier understanding.",rate:"Speech Rate",speed:"Acceleration",pauseBefore:"Pause Before Sentence",pauseAfter:"Pause After Sentence",language:"Languag